      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im writing a paper for my international relations class about economic sanctions. i'm stuck on the conclusion though. basically, are sanctions actually an effective way to promote democracy and hold regimes accountable, or are they just a tool for powerful countries to bully smaller ones? which side has more weight in current geopolitical theory?",
