      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, even if they're imperfect, calling democracy promotion a \"grand illusion\" seems way too cynical. don't a lot of policy experts argue that sanctions are a necessary middle ground to avoid actually going to war? isn't it a valid tool for maintaining global order even if it's not a perfect fix?",
